<title>RUSSIA: Russia's RTS share index closed at record 369.00.</title>
<headline>Russia's RTS share index closed at record 369.00.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Russian Trading System (RTS) 22-share index closed at a record 369.00 on Monday, up from 364.78 on Friday, the NAUFOR brokers association said.</p>
<p>Total reported trading volume for all shares on the RTS was a healthy $54.97 million. The previous record was 366.80 during trading on May 19.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
